# Nova Pentacle and Lava Burst: Lava Burst's damage "can't be prevented or dealt instead to another permanent or player"
# only where it would be dealt to a creature; its ruling: redirection effects "will work on damage that Lava Burst would
# deal to a player" (CR 614.9, 616.1f). Bot2 casts Lava Burst with X 1 at Bot1, who responds with the Pentacle; Bot2 targets
# Bot1's Sanctuary Cat (1/2), and as the ability resolves Bot1 chooses Lava Burst on the stack as the source (CR 609.7a).
# Its 1 damage to Bot1 is dealt to the Cat instead: the Cat has 1 damage marked, and Bot1 stays at 20.

